etica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">美团开源商用级数字人模型LongCat-Video-Avatar1.5，推理效率提升15倍</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">CapCut与Google Gemini达成深度集成合作，支持在App内调用视频编辑功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic预计第二季度营收达109亿美元并实现首度盈利</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">钉钉发布全球首个企业级AI原生工作平台“悟空”，实现复杂任务自主执行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e646ecd29055c89e3b78746923577760.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月21日，钉钉在成都峰会正式发布全球首个企业级AI原生工作平台“钉钉悟空”。该平台基于自研的多智能体（Multi-Agent）架构，标志着企业AI应用从辅助工具向可独立执行复杂任务的“智能伙伴”转型。悟空具备自主执行、场景联动、人人可用三大核心能力，用户通过自然语言即可下达指令，由AI自动拆解目标、跨系统调用ERP/CRM数据并完成协同。在实战中，悟空已在智能制造、跨境电商及现代服务业实现显著提效，如排产周期缩短70%、法务审核效率提升3倍。钉钉目前服务近2600万企业组织，此次发布旨在通过AI主动推送洞察，重塑企业生产力，推动企业从“人找数据”向“AI驱动业务”升级，为企业级AI的大规模商业化落地树立了技术标杆。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌推出“内置 Gemini”解决方案，全面赋能第三方智能音箱与摄像头</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1371ab9044c65d65de9f21ac4a30ecab.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于5月21日正式推出“内置 Gemini”（Gemini built-in）解决方案，旨在将大模型能力全面引入第三方智能家居硬件。该方案首期聚焦智能音箱与智能摄像头，通过向开发者开放 Google Home 底层高阶智能功能，提供完整的硬件参考设计，助力合作伙伴缩短研发周期。沃尔玛旗下 Onn 品牌智能音箱将成为首批试水产品。此外，谷歌允许运营商将 Google Home Premium 与 Gemini 能力集成至自有应用，美国电信巨头 AT&amp;T 已率先在其 Connected Life 安全服务中接入 Nest Cam 的 AI 功能。此次技术输出标志着谷歌正加速复制 Google Assistant 的生态扩张路径，推动智能家居从“设备互联”向由端侧大模型驱动的“真智能”时代转型。随着相关硬件在202</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团开源商用级数字人模型LongCat-Video-Avatar1.5，推理效率提升15倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/02a31a6908dd9f58656ff96cf0498314.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团龙猫大模型团队正式开源商用级数字人视频生成模型LongCat-Video-Avatar1.5。该模型在唇形同步、物理合理性及多人互动等维度实现跃升，通过将音频编码器升级为Whisper-large，并引入GRPO技术优化手部动作与连续性，有效解决传统数字人抖动与畸变问题。在推理效率方面，该模型采用DMD分布匹配蒸馏技术，将生成步数从50步压缩至8步，配合“共享基础模型+LoRA适配器”架构，实现15倍推理效率提升。基于EvalTalker基准评测，该模型在用户偏好胜率上全面领先，对比Kling Avatar2.0、OmniHuman-1.5及HeyGen的胜率分别达到65.9%、61.1%和54.3%。此次开源旨在为全球开发者提供可验证的技术基座，推动数字人技术在电商直播、教育及娱乐等复杂商业场景的落地应用</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">CapCut与Google Gemini达成深度集成合作，支持在App内调用视频编辑功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ae94b1be4adf09642df3706f0be7b672.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">CapCut正式宣布与Google Gemini App达成深度集成合作，用户未来将能直接在Gemini应用内调用CapCut的高级创意与视频编辑功能。此次合作旨在通过技术互联，实现创作流程的对话化与直观化，让用户无需频繁切换应用即可完成图像与视频的专业级编辑。集成功能涵盖CapCut的核心视频剪辑、智能特效及创意模板，显著降低了跨平台操作的复杂性。CapCut官方表示，双方将共同打造更无缝、高效的AI创作体验，推动专业编辑能力在内容创作领域的普及。目前该合作处于初步阶段，更多关于功能细节与正式上线时间的信息，双方将在后续进一步披露。此次集成不仅提升了Gemini的生产力属性，也标志着CapCut在AI生态互联布局上的重要进展。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic预计第二季度营收达109亿美元并实现首度盈利</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/04bd262e29e0472ec5b42c635c48be1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic预计今年第二季度营收环比激增130%至109亿美元，并实现5.59亿美元营业利润，成为全球首家宣告盈利的前沿AI实验室。增长核心源于编码工具的企业端普及及Claude在自主智能体（Agent）场景的强劲需求。为应对算力缺口，Anthropic已签署新数据中心协议并与SpaceX合作。尽管新旗舰模型Opus 4.7因分词器调整导致Token消耗增加12%至30%，但公司资源利用效率显著提升，每1美元收入对应的计算成本从一季度的71美分降至56美分。相比OpenAI通过GPT-5.5激进提价，Anthropic凭借轻资产运营及与谷歌、亚马逊的深度投资协议实现成本回落。此举标志着生成式AI产业正从非理性军备竞赛转向追求高投资回报率（ROI）的商业化阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
